A||||6||JetroGT||Who's ever driven thier fiero on a frozen lake?||||10||
Z||000000||JetroGT||02-02-2001||08:30 PM||||When I lived in Wisconsin a friend and I would take the fiero out on the lake to go Ice Fishing. It was a gold 5spd 2M4. We would get up to about 55 and then put the car into a spin. And as I would up shift the car would spin even faster! I just kind of miss some of that snow. ||||reg||10
