Z||000003||frontal lobe||02-04-2001||01:30 AM||||I could (I live in Wisconsin), but haven't.  Can you get a reckless driving ticket on a lake??||||reg||1
Z||000004||JetroGT||02-04-2001||05:45 AM||||That almost looked like Branard, MN. They always have an Ice Fishing tournament with good prizes like trucks, snow mobiles, and ATV's. This is the first year that I missed it. ||||reg||1
Z||000005||wkayl||02-04-2001||09:52 AM||||JetroGT, I went to the Brainard fishing derby in 92.  It is put on by the JayCees.  I was president of the Morris JayCees at the time. A buddy of mine that we talked into going along won a fishing trip for 2 to Canada as a door prize.<BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/outline.jpg">   <BR>86GT original paint, interior, engine  <A HREF="http://www.fierowayne.homestead.com/fierowayne.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fierowayne.homestead.com/fierowayne.html</A> ||||reg||1
